{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a81p","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Cooperative stop is enforced by the daemon inside next_action","summary":"The heartbeat tick runs in-process so the PreToolUse stop hook cannot interrupt it. Instead every next_action first polls the loop’s stop signal (cancel on the loop’s claimed task or stop on its agent); if set it returns stop and clears loop.active, so the loop self-exits within one iteration. Pass session to loop_start to arm this.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a81p","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Cooperative stop is enforced by the daemon inside next_action","summary":"The heartbeat tick runs in-process so the PreToolUse stop hook cannot interrupt it. Instead every next_action first polls the loop’s stop signal (cancel on the loop’s claimed task or stop on its agent); if set it returns stop and clears loop.active, so the loop self-exits within one iteration. Pass session to loop_start to arm this.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:08:57.822Z"}
